<HR size="1" color="#5d7790">
<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Wow.  What a night.  I'm still attempting to wake up, didn't end up going to bed until almost 3 am.  <P>So, did we learn anything from that whole debacle?  I personally think things were fine except for two fatal flaws, one of which we couldn't have handled any differently than we did.  <BR>Fatal Flaw #1 - Half the raid going visible shortly after zone in.  Not much we could do about it though.<BR>Fatal Flaw #2 - The call to camp because of a Tranquil Treant just minutes before the PoGs were due to spawn.  The call to camp wasn't wrong, but I can't imagine the timing being much worse than it was.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  If you take away those 2 things, I think we would have had a successful night.  Oh well, water under the bridge.<P>After the PoG raid, I went back to the dorfs in east wastes for a bit, but I'm getting tired of killing those guys, so I hitched a ride to Lavastorm from Leat and gave the ogres in neriak a go.  On my first attempt my pet got owned hard, and I zoned out with a bubble of health left.  2nd try worked pretty good, I ended up just root/dotting the guy, and didn't even use my pet.  The guy I had killed was a level 45'ish warrior and had a TON of HP.  Right near him is a shadowknight, I decided to try him next.  Again, he owned my pet, but I was prepared this time, so I just finished him off with root/dots.  Killed him a total of 5 times and got a blue bubble of exp.  I think I found my new exp home.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  He dropped up to 8pp per kill, and a couple research words, but that was about it.  So, if you see me online, I'll most likely be in neriak making crazy exp.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 54th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Bertox. Server<P>Sendil- 50th Level Rogue<BR>Solusek Ro Server
</FONT>
